    "problems": "The reported defense results are limited to two model families and three harmful datasets; the main strict-threshold setting relies on calibration that fully covers the harmful reference data. RepNoise has runs with severe generation-quality degradation for which ASR is not a meaningful comparison. No uncertainty estimates are reported.",
    "rows_left_out": "No qualifying Table 1 ASR results left out. Other reported measures, including safe-pass rates, harmful-block rates, restoration accuracy, and representation norm ratios, do not directly measure a claim version's harmful-compliance behavior.",
    "untested": [
